  "description": "The new multi\u2011tenant service has been defined as **appserver**, using the standard **appserver** cartridge type. It will be deployed under the **D1** deployment policy and will automatically scale according to the **AS1** autoscaling policy. The service is intended to be publicly accessible (isPublic\u202f=\u202ftrue) and will serve all tenants (tenantRange\u202f=\u202f*).\n\nThe service\u2019s cluster will be hosted at the domain **appserverdev.dev.domain**, with the sub\u2011domain **subdomain2** assigned to it. All of these settings together configure the appserver service for immediate rollout in the development environment.",
